+### Supplied Sileo screenshots and target-first details — 2026-10-20
+
+The human supplied IMG_0003.PNG (Sources), IMG_0004.PNG (repository overview), IMG_0001.PNG (Packages with swipe Uninstall) and IMG_0002.PNG (banner/detail). These four files are the selected visual references; retain exactly three destinations Sources, Packages, Scripts. This updates the concrete mock proposal, without implying native implementation adoption. Use edge-to-edge compact rows, a large title, Source Edit/+ controls, All Packages above Repositories, search/Installed/name sort in Packages, and a compact banner/detail intro. Dark surfaces are approximately #1e1e1e with muted gray separators and teal actions; light surfaces retain system semantics.
+
